│ ▌ colorscheme  load named colorscheme <pad> │
ok   colorscheme prompts
│ ▌ lsp-rename-prompt    <space>r   Rename symbol under the main cursor (prompt for a new name) <pad> │
New name: include
│ ▌ :tree-sitter-nav '"parent"' <pad> <space>ts   select parent <pad> │
│ ▌ :surround-add                  ms         surround add <pad> ││
│ ▌ :clipboard-yank -main          <space>Y   yank main selection to clipboard <pad> ││
│ ▌ :tmux-here resize-pane -Z -t %val{client_env_TMUX_PANE}  <c-w>z    zoom this split (toggle) <pad> │
│ > zz test <pad> N/N │
│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│ ▌ :echo zz <pad> <space>Z  zz test <pad> │
